F — Manual Behaviour Checks:
1. Create valid objects:
p = Patient("P001", "Sarah Lee", "0400 000 000")
pr = Practitioner("DR01", "Dr Patel", "General Medicine")
a = Appointment("A001", "2024-08-01", "09:00", p, pr)

2. Test invalid input:
Patient("P002", "", "0400 000 111")  # raises ValueError

3. Cancel scheduled appointment:
a.cancel()
print(a.status)  # CANCELLED

4. Illegal repeated transition:
a.cancel()
a.complete()  # raises ValueError

